    {
      "id": "HYkyEH9CDniKtVkTgQEjU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1077.8545301424874,
      "y": 395.34130612198305,
      "width": 2059.389570661245,
      "height": 126.17560353153858,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b09",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 895723368,
      "version": 52,
      "versionNonce": 1132119064,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766605455836,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AI如果只是一个概率机器的话，那我无法理解的就是我说的话调整了他也可以，进而调整\n他内容，好像看起来是有逻辑的",
      "fontSize": 52.57316813814108,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AI如果只是一个概率机器的话，那我无法理解的就是我说的话调整了他也可以，进而调整他内容，好像看起来是有逻辑的",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "-KgSDrepjyxV3kldk9nEL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1121.3916855746866,
      "y": 556.1027317225921,
      "width": 2102.926725525643,
      "height": 126.17560353153858,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 608860776,
      "version": 54,
      "versionNonce": 1502947688,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766605455836,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "还有一点就是如果概率机器，那我投喂的数据量更大越来越多，那他只是更好的是掌握了该\n回答我什么，也就是说他只是一个更好的汇聚所有的知识，并给他吐出来的机器",
      "fontSize": 52.57316813814108,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "还有一点就是如果概率机器，那我投喂的数据量更大越来越多，那他只是更好的是掌握了该回答我什么，也就是说他只是一个更好的汇聚所有的知识，并给他吐出来的机器",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "U-vnh-1KIAqg47l36nL1n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1099.6231075746869,
      "y": 763.3534834403165,
      "width": 2102.926725525643,
      "height": 189.26340529730788,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1423895912,
      "version": 62,
      "versionNonce": 347767064,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766605455836,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "但是由于他提升了人类的生产力，人类可以开发研究出更好的理论，创造出更好的工具，进\n而发展出更多的知识，而又回头喂给他反过来投喂给他更多的数据，那这个数据的质量增\n高，他用的继续发展，所以这个循环发展会非常大的促进整个知识的增长",
      "fontSize": 52.57316813814108,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "但是由于他提升了人类的生产力，人类可以开发研究出更好的理论，创造出更好的工具，进而发展出更多的知识，而又回头喂给他反过来投喂给他更多的数据，那这个数据的质量增高，他用的继续发展，所以这个循环发展会非常大的促进整个知识的增长",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "2Qk_JsGh9Dk1G62mMAT_C",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2452.600279841141,
      "y": 1194.4534622391184,
      "width": 4689.8779296875,
      "height": 108.2330398605397,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 7143528,
      "version": 103,
      "versionNonce": 184269928,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766605455836,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "但它至少给我的一个思考就是比如说机器人这一块可以从硬编码到自然选择（这里的自然选择指的是让他自己去学习）",
      "fontSize": 90.19419988378309,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "但它至少给我的一个思考就是比如说机器人这一块可以从硬编码到自然选择（这里的自然选择指的是让他自己去学习）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "2C_PvI8QViKkNllhIfMu3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1418.845172519019,
      "y": 1380.3009569825222,
      "width": 2319.8994140625,
      "height": 126.54457026500496,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1455469416,
      "version": 36,
      "versionNonce": 16424472,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766605455836,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "我认为获得真正的智能是需要一种哲学理念的转变",
      "fontSize": 105.4538085541708,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "我认为获得真正的智能是需要一种哲学理念的转变",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "iOKWWZWMKemw_GFD4mJjK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1418.8451725523605,
      "y": 1560.2916216673584,
      "width": 2970,
      "height": 99,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 774243944,
      "version": 52,
      "versionNonce": 404221800,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766605455836,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "不过在此之前你要定义好什么才算真正的智能以不同的定义延展出不同的哲学理念",
      "fontSize": 82.5,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "不过在此之前你要定义好什么才算真正的智能以不同的定义延展出不同的哲学理念",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "myBypXgJcFSb1WJqr7RYk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1129.2797199167844,
      "y": 1814.8616283445003,
      "width": 1021.5599975585938,
      "height": 204.32368100740848,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 862517608,
      "version": 30,
      "versionNonce": 154082072,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766605455836,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "生产力会暴涨",
      "fontSize": 170.2697341728404,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "生产力会暴涨",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "5-Jhi7WhABAh_133DbwMZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1121.3916859167844,
      "y": 2077.605971737095,
      "width": 3010.100830078125,
      "height": 132.94555727530945,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 433425512,
      "version": 61,
      "versionNonce": 959824488,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766605455836,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "当我在想如何把人脑直接和AI进行互动这样的话信息会更准确",
      "fontSize": 110.78796439609123,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "当我在想如何把人脑直接和AI进行互动这样的话信息会更准确",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
